# shield/kite: the Kite shield (P2c slice, SLICE-HELM-SHIELD; form2, shape3): the town guard's. On the off arm's grip
# (gripL, shield/arm). The face: a steel rim (lit left and top, shadowed right), the field in three steps lit as a convex
# face (Field slot: the accent by default, a maker's paint when set) and a 5 px cross device centred in the upper half
# (Device slot: two steps, the kingdom's gold on its red). The back: wooden boards (leather steps 1-2), the strap across
# with its brass buckle, the rim. Layers by facing (STYLE_P2 25.5): facing down and left it is in front (its face; facing
# left over the chest and belly, its rim at the shoulder line, never over the face), facing up its back at screen left
# behind the arm, facing right behind the body (its back shows past the back); guard and block bring it before the chest
# (edge-on facing right). Keys: rest (it hangs still on the arm), guard (raised to the chest), block (squared to the
# threat, the rim catching a glint at its top-left: the delight), lie (flat beside the corpse: the fall's turned frames
# are composed facing left), back (slung on the back for seated and kneeling postures, on the neck). Format: doll.h.
use person
body adult
role shield form2
role shield shape3
layer shield
anchor gripL
keys shield
tags overlay
legend R field 1
legend S field 2
legend T field 3
legend F device 2
legend J device 3
